    "text": "One of three Epic Collection theme decks released on 9 May 2007, each built around a Johto first partner's final form as a Pokémon-ex and a Hoenn first partner's line, mostly from EX Emerald and EX Unseen Forces cards. This Water and Psychic deck held 60 cards, among them Feraligatr ex, Swampert and Slowbro, with a rulebook, damage and status counters, a coin and a playmat. Its non-holo copies of Feraligatr, Swampert and Slowbro are found only in this deck.",
